# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensitive / unpublished research data -- MUST NOT be published.
# This is a public repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Sample metadata: 457 rows incl. specimen IDs and the latitude/longitude of
# collection sites. Supply your own with --samplesheet.
assets/samplesheet.xlsx
assets/*samplesheet*.xlsx
assets/samplesheet.backup_*.xlsx

# Real sequencing reads and ONT sequencing summaries from the study mosquitoes.
assets/test_data/

# Generated run samplesheets: they embed absolute paths to the local data.
assets/runs.csv
assets/test_runs.csv

# Third-party / copyrighted provenance material (MalariaGEN eLife-2015 k13 table,
# amplicon design documents, earlier curation spreadsheets). Kept locally as the
# evidence trail for assets/resources/; not ours to redistribute.
docs/provenance/*
!docs/provenance/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binaries -- fetch these rather than versioning them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Clair3 basecalling model (~78 MB). Download the model matching your chemistry
# from ONT Rerio: https://github.com/nanoporetech/rerio
# Model binaries are obtained per PROVENANCE.md (large, licence-gated); keep the
# provenance + checksum docs tracked so a clean clone knows how to fetch/verify.
assets/references/clair3_models/*
!assets/references/clair3_models/PROVENANCE.md
!assets/references/clair3_models/PROVENANCE.sha256

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nextflow scratch, caches and results
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
work/
work_*/
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
results/
results_*/
nextflow_results/
*.trace.txt
trace-*.txt
timeline-*.html
report-*.html
dag-*.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.Rhistory
.RData

# Stale/local generated run manifests (machine-specific paths)
assets/runs.metadata*.csv
